  "description": "The Energy is loaded with features and looks fantastic. Of course the Energy is terrific for weekend touring or for running errands. The Energy shares the same frame as the Dynamo, just a little bit nicer parts spec. The Energy is a little raciest option of our Flat-Bar line up. With a lighter alloy fork, lighter faster tires but with the simplicity of a 1X drivetrain that saves weight, adds reliability and reduces maintenance. The Energy still has all the gear range range you need for quick energy rides or long sustained climbs. The Energy is a bike that’s stands out and people notice.",
